# Source and fixtures are read byte-for-byte by tests that substitute into
# them, and by hashes that must reproduce across machines. A CRLF working tree
# makes those comparisons silently no-match (hazard 12: two checkouts of one
# commit behaving as different products). Pin the working-tree form so
# core.autocrlf cannot reintroduce it.
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
